                            <p></p><h3>Definition of "mini-k":</h3><p><b>Mini K</b> is the name of a series of low-cost, high-quality condenser microphones from Roswell Pro Audio. As of 2022, this line includes:</p><ul><li>Mini K47</li><li>Mini K87</li><li>Mini K47 KD</li><li>Mini K67x</li></ul><p>The product names are essentially literal descriptions of each mic: &#8220;mini&#8221; refers to the relatively small size of the microphone body. K47/K67/K87 identify the capsule type. The &#8220;x&#8221; in the K67x refers to the output transformer.</p>
